Done. I combined all 16 JSON-defined functions from `guides/6/all.R/` into `r2py_kernsmooth/__init__.py`:

- **14 public functions** (`bkde`, `bkde2D`, `bkfe`, `blkest`, `cpblock`, `dpih`, `dpik`, `dpill`, `linbin`, `linbin2D`, `locpoly`, `rlbin`, `sdiag`, `sstdiag`) plus the two R lifecycle hooks (`on_attach`, `_on_unload`), kept private/undocumented in `__all__` as before.
